Welcome to Devpit

Devpit is a pit stop for your dev machine: free disk space, fix stuck ports, and keep your tools up
to date, from one menu.

  ● Nothing is deleted without a preview and an explicit confirmation.
  ● The default answer on every confirmation is No.
  ● Nothing leaves this machine unless you turn usage stats on.

Do all of these render?   ✓ ● ▸  

  ▸ Glyphs render correctly: No
    (Yes turns on the Nerd Font icon tier. No keeps the plain unicode one.)

    Theme: auto
    (auto follows your terminal background)

    Usage stats: No
    (Help show how much space Devpit saves? Only totals are sent — no file names or paths.)

    Start using Devpit
    (Saves these answers. You can change all of them in Settings.)



